If a clinician prescribes an opioid then the clinician should identify an opioid-use-disorder-treatment-resource in a community.
If a clinician prescribes an opioid then the clinician should establish an opioid-use-disorder-referral-network in a community.
Every opioid-use-disorder-referral-network should span a patient-needed-level-of-care.
If a rapid-clinical-collaboration is needed then every opioid-use-disorder-referral-network can enable the rapid-clinical-collaboration.
If a rapid-patient-referral is needed then every opioid-use-disorder-referral-network can enable the rapid-patient-referral.
If a clinician prescribes an opioid then the clinician should participate in an opioid-prescribing-clinician-collaboration.
Every opioid-prescribing-clinician-collaboration should ensure a sufficient-opioid-use-disorder-treatment-capacity at a clinical-practice-organization.
